S-AP)\",\"ar\":\"جدول الحركة: Trade payables (LS-AP)\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"sch_ap\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Trade payables movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"جدول حركة Trade payables\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"component\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Component\",\"ar\":\"المكوّن\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"trade_payables\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Trade payables\",\"ar\":\"الدائنون التجاريون\"}},{\"value\":\"other_payables\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Other payables\",\"ar\":\"دائنون آخرون\"}}]},{\"id\":\"opening\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Opening balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الافتتاحي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"additions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Invoiced\",\"ar\":\"المفوتر\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"disposals\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Paid\",\"ar\":\"المسدد\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"transfers\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Transfers and reclassifications\",\"ar\":\"التحويلات وإعادة التبويب\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"revaluation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Revaluation or remeasurement\",\"ar\":\"إعادة التقييم أو إعادة القياس\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"other\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Other movements\",\"ar\":\"حركات أخرى\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"closing\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Closing balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الختامي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true}]},{\"id\":\"sch_ap_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-AP.difference\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_ap_agrees\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Schedule agrees to the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-AP.agrees\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_ap_opening_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the opening total and the prior period\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-AP.opening_difference\",\"readonly\":true}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Trade and other payables reconciled from the opening to the closing balance. Required by IAS 1.77. Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Trade payables (LS-AP) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.\",\"ar\":\"يشترطه IAS 1.77. الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Trade payables (LS-AP) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق.\"}}],\"signoff\":{\"prepare\":[\"partner\",\"manager\",\"senior\",\"staff\"],\"review\":[\"partner\",\"manager\"],\"approve\":[\"partner\"]},\"computation\":\"rollforward\",\"version\":2,\"ar_status\":\"draft_pending_review\"}"),
    ("F33-PAYROLL", "{\"id\":\"F33-PAYROLL\",\"number\":33,\"kind\":\"worksheet\",\"phase\":\"fieldwork\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Payroll working paper\",\"ar\":\"ورقة عمل الرواتب والأجور\"},\"purpose\":{\"en\":\"Document every substantive procedure of the payroll cycle: the work, the results, the evidence and the conclusion, against the balances the trial balance holds.\",\"ar\":\"توثيق كل إجراء أساسي في دورة الرواتب والأجور: العمل والنتائج والأدلة والاستنتاج، مقابل الأرصدة الواردة في ميزان المراجعة.\"},\"procedures\":[\"P-PAY-003\",\"P-PAY-004\",\"P-PAY-005\",\"P-PAY-006\"],\"standards\":[\"ISA-330\",\"ISA-520\",\"ISA-530\",\"ISA-540\",\"ISA-250\"],\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"engagement\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Engagement\",\"ar\":\"الارتباط\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"client\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Entity audited\",\"ar\":\"المنشأة محل المراجعة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.client\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_start\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period from\",\"ar\":\"الفترة من\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_start\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_end\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period to\",\"ar\":\"الفترة إلى\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_end\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"framework\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Financial reporting framework\",\"ar\":\"إطار التقرير المالي\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.framework\",\"readonly\":true}]},{\"id\":\"balances\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Balances, materiality and risks\",\"ar\":\"الأرصدة والأهمية النسبية والمخاطر\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"performance_materiality\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performance materiality\",\"ar\":\"مادية الأداء\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.performance\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"clearly_trivial\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Clearly trivial threshold\",\"ar\":\"حد المبالغ التافهة بشكل واضح\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.clearly_trivial\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_ebo\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Employee benefit obligations (LS-EBO)\",\"ar\":\"Employee benefit obligations (LS-EBO)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-EBO\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_ebo_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Employee benefit obligations, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Employee benefit obligations، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-EBO.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_payl\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Payroll liabilities (LS-PAYL)\",\"ar\":\"Payroll liabilities (LS-PAYL)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PAYL\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_payl_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Payroll liabilities, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Payroll liabilities، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PAYL.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_staff\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Staff costs (LS-STAFF)\",\"ar\":\"Staff costs (LS-STAFF)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-STAFF\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_staff_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Staff costs, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Staff costs، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-STAFF.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"risks\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risks placed on this cycle by the risk register\",\"ar\":\"المخاطر الموضوعة على هذه الدورة في سجل المخاطر\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"form.F04-RISK-REGISTER.risks\",\"readonly\":true,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"level\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Level\",\"ar\":\"المستوى\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"assertions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Assertions affected\",\"ar\":\"الإقرارات المتأثرة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"inherent_risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Inherent risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر الملازم\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"significant\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Significant risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر مهم\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"control_risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Control risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر الرقابة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"response\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Planned response\",\"ar\":\"الاستجابة المخططة\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":false}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Balances are read from the latest accepted trial balance and frozen when the paper is prepared; a later import marks them as drifted.\",\"ar\":\"تُقرأ الأرصدة من أحدث ميزان مراجعة مقبول وتُثبت عند إعداد الورقة؛ ويؤدي استيراد لاحق إلى وسمها بأنها تغيرت.\"}},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"P-PAY-003 Payroll proof in total\",\"ar\":\"P-PAY-003 إثبات الرواتب في المجموع\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_work\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Work performed\",\"ar\":\"العمل المنفذ\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_result\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Results and exceptions\",\"ar\":\"النتائج والاستثناءات\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_samples\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-PAY-003\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-PAY-003\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_flagged\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Lines flagged by the analytical review paper\",\"ar\":\"البنود المعلَّمة في ورقة الفحص التحليلي\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.analytical_review.lines_flagged\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable, reason stated\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق، مع بيان السبب\"}}]},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_s1_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"ISA-520.5: When designing substantive analytical procedures, determine their suitability for the assertions given the assessed risks and any tests of details, evaluate the reliability of the data behind the expectation (source, comparability, nature, relevance and controls over preparation), develop an expectation precise enough to identify a material misstatement, and set the difference from the expectation that is acceptable without investigation.\",\"ar\":\"ISA-520.5: When designing substantive analytical procedures, determine their suitability for the assertions given the assessed risks and any tests of details, evaluate the reliability of the data behind the expectation (source, comparability, nature, relevance and controls over preparation), develop an expectation precise enough to identify a material misstatement, and set the difference from the expectation that is acceptable without investigation.\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق\"}}],\"step\":\"ISA-520.5\"},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_s1_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing step 1\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بالخطوة 1\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-PAY-003.step.ISA-520.5\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_s1_ticks\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Tick marks on step 1\",\"ar\":\"علامات التدقيق على الخطوة 1\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.ticks.P-PAY-003.ISA-520.5\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_s1_citation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Record cited for the exception on step 1 (a misstatement, a review note or a communication)\",\"ar\":\"السجل المستشهد به للاستثناء في الخطوة 1 (تحريف أو ملاحظة مراجعة أو مراسلة)\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"required_if\":{\"field\":\"p_pay_003_s1_conclusion\",\"equals\":\"performed_exception\",\"message\":{\"en\":\"a step concluded with an exception cites the misstatement, review note or communication it raised\",\"ar\":\"الخطوة التي خُلص فيها إلى استثناء تستشهد بالتحريف أو ملاحظة المراجعة أو المراسلة التي أثارتها\"}},\"cites\":[\"RK-MISSTATEMENT\",\"RK-REVIEW-NOTE\",\"RK-COMMUNICATION\"]},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_s2_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"ISA-520.7: Investigate significant differences or inconsistent relationships by inquiring of management and corroborating its responses, and by performing other procedures as necessary.\",\"ar\":\"ISA-520.7: Investigate significant differences or inconsistent relationships by inquiring of management and corroborating its responses, and by performing other procedures as necessary.\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق\"}}],\"step\":\"ISA-520.7\"},{\"id\":\"p_pay_003_s2_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing step 2\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بالخطوة 2\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"recor