والاستثناءات\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_009_samples\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-PPE-009\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_009_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-PPE-009\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_009_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable, reason stated\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق، مع بيان السبب\"}}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Obtain evidence over the measurement of investment property.\",\"ar\":\"Obtain evidence over the measurement of investment property.\"}},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_010\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"P-PPE-010 Non-current asset presentation and commitments\",\"ar\":\"P-PPE-010 عرض الأصول غير المتداولة والارتباطات الرأسمالية\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"p_ppe_010_work\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Work performed\",\"ar\":\"العمل المنفذ\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_010_result\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Results and exceptions\",\"ar\":\"النتائج والاستثناءات\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_010_samples\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-PPE-010\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_010_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-PPE-010\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_ppe_010_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable, reason stated\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق، مع بيان السبب\"}}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Evaluate disclosures of non-current assets.\",\"ar\":\"Evaluate disclosures of non-current assets.\"}},{\"id\":\"sch_ppe\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Movement schedule: Property, plant and equipment (LS-PPE)\",\"ar\":\"جدول الحركة: Property, plant and equipment (LS-PPE)\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"sch_ppe\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Property, plant and equipment movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"جدول حركة Property, plant and equipment\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"component\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Component\",\"ar\":\"المكوّن\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"cost\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Cost\",\"ar\":\"التكلفة\"}},{\"value\":\"accumulated_depreciation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Accumulated depreciation and impairment\",\"ar\":\"مجمع الإهلاك والاضمحلال\"}}]},{\"id\":\"opening\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Opening balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الافتتاحي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"additions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Additions\",\"ar\":\"الإضافات\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"disposals\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Disposals\",\"ar\":\"الاستبعادات\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"transfers\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Transfers and reclassifications\",\"ar\":\"التحويلات وإعادة التبويب\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"revaluation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Revaluation\",\"ar\":\"إعادة التقييم\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"other\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Depreciation charge and impairment\",\"ar\":\"عبء الإهلاك والاضمحلال\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"closing\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Closing balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الختامي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true}]},{\"id\":\"sch_ppe_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-PPE.difference\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_ppe_agrees\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Schedule agrees to the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-PPE.agrees\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_ppe_opening_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the opening total and the prior period\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-PPE.opening_difference\",\"readonly\":true}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Cost and accumulated depreciation reconciled from the opening to the closing carrying amount. Required by IAS 16.73(e). Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component; Accumulated depreciation and impairment is stated positive and deducted. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Property, plant and equipment (LS-PPE) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.\",\"ar\":\"يشترطه IAS 16.73(e). الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن؛ ويُذكر المكوّن المقابل موجباً ويُخصم. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Property, plant and equipment (LS-PPE) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق.\"}},{\"id\":\"sch_intg\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Movement schedule: Intangible assets (LS-INTG)\",\"ar\":\"جدول الحركة: Intangible assets (LS-INTG)\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"sch_intg\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Intangible assets movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"جدول حركة Intangible assets\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"component\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Component\",\"ar\":\"المكوّن\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"cost\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Cost\",\"ar\":\"التكلفة\"}},{\"value\":\"accumulated_amortisation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Accumulated amortisation and impairment\",\"ar\":\"مجمع الاستهلاك والاضمحلال\"}}]},{\"id\":\"opening\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Opening balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الافتتاحي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"additions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Additions\",\"ar\":\"الإضافات\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"disposals\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Disposals\",\"ar\":\"الاستبعادات\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"transfers\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Transfers and reclassifications\",\"ar\":\"التحويلات وإعادة التبويب\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"revaluation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Revaluation\",\"ar\":\"إعادة التقييم\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"other\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Amortisation charge and impairment\",\"ar\":\"عبء الاستهلاك والاضمحلال\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"closing\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Closing balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الختامي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true}]},{\"id\":\"sch_intg_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-INTG.difference\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_intg_agrees\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Schedule agrees to the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-INTG.agrees\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_intg_opening_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the opening total and the prior period\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-INTG.opening_difference\",\"readonly\":true}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Cost and accumulated amortisation reconciled from the opening to the closing carrying amount. Required by IAS 38.118(e). Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component; Accumulated amortisation and impairment is stated positive and deducted. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Intangible assets and goodwill (LS-INTG) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.\",\"ar\":\"يشترطه IAS 38.118(e). الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن؛ ويُذكر المكوّن المقابل موجباً ويُخصم. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Intangible assets and goodwill (LS-INTG) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق.\"}},{\"id\":\"sch_invp\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Movement schedule: Investment property (LS-INVP)\",\"ar\":\"جدول الحركة: Investment property (LS-INVP)\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"sch_invp\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Investment property movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"جدول حركة Investment property\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"component\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Component\",\"ar\":\"المكوّن\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"carrying_amount\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Carrying amount\",\"ar\":\"القيمة الدفترية\"}}]},{\"id\":\"opening\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Opening balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الافتتاحي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"additions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Additions\",\"ar\":\"الإضافات\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"disposals\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Disposals\",\"ar\":\"الاستبعادات\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"transfers\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Transfers and reclassifications\",\"ar\":\"التحويلات وإعادة التبويب\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"revaluation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Fair value gains and losses\",\"ar\":\"أرباح وخسائر القيمة العادلة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"other\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Depreciation and impairment\",\"ar\":\"الإهلاك والاضمحلال\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"closing\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Closing balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الختامي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true}]},{\"id\":\"sch_invp_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-INVP.difference\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_invp_agrees\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Schedule agrees to the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-INVP.agrees\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_invp_opening_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the opening total and the prior period\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-INVP.opening_difference\",\"readonly\":true}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"The carrying amount reconciled from the opening to the closing balance. Required by IAS 40.76 and 40.79(d). Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Investment property (LS-INVP) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.\",\"ar\":\"يشترطه IAS 40.76 and 40.79(d). الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Investment property (LS-INVP) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق.\"}}],\"signoff\":{\"prepare\":[\"partner\",\"manager\",\"senior\",\"staff\"],\"review\":[\"partner\",\"manager\"],\"approve\":[\"partner\"]},\"computation\":\"rollforward\",\"version\":2,\"ar_status\":\"draft_pending_review\"}"),
    ("F36-TREASURY", "{\"id\":\"F36-TREASURY\",\"number\":36,\"kind\":\"worksheet\",\"phase\":\"fieldwork\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Treasury and financial instruments working paper\",\"ar\":\"ورقة عمل الخزينة والأدوات المالية\"},\"purpose\":{\"en\":\"Document every substantive procedure of the treasury and financial instruments cycle: the work, the results, the evidence and the conclusion, against the balances the trial balance holds.\",\"ar\":\"توثيق كل إجراء أساسي في دورة الخزينة والأدوات المالية: العمل والنتائج والأدلة والاستنتاج، مقابل الأرصدة الواردة في ميزان المراجعة.\"},\"procedures\":[\"P-TRE-002\",\"P-TRE-003\",\"P-TRE-004\",\"P-TRE-005\",\"P-TRE-006\",\"P-TRE-007\",\"P-TRE-008\",\"P-TRE-009\",\"P-TRE-010\"],\"standards\":[\"ISA-330\",\"ISA-500\",\"ISA-505\",\"ISA-540\",\"ISA-570\",\"ISA-700\"],\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"engagement\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Engagement\",\"ar\":\"الارتباط\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"client\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Entity audited\",\"ar\":\"المنشأة محل المراجعة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.client\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_start\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period from\",\"ar\":\"الفترة من\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_start\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_end\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period to\",\"ar\":\"الفترة إلى\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_end\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"framework\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Financial reporting framework\",\"ar\":\"إطار التقرير المالي\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.framework\",\"readonly\":true}]},{\"id\":\"balances\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Balances, materiality and risks\",\"ar\":\"الأرصدة والأهمية النسبية والمخاطر\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"performance_materiality\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performance materiality\",\"ar\":\"مادية الأداء\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.performance\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\