 over non-controlling interests and other components of equity.\"}},{\"id\":\"p_eqy_005\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"P-EQY-005 Statement of changes in equity and disclosures\",\"ar\":\"P-EQY-005 قائمة التغيرات في حقوق الملكية والإفصاحات\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"p_eqy_005_work\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Work performed\",\"ar\":\"العمل المنفذ\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_eqy_005_result\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Results and exceptions\",\"ar\":\"النتائج والاستثناءات\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_eqy_005_samples\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-EQY-005\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_eqy_005_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-EQY-005\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_eqy_005_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable, reason stated\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق، مع بيان السبب\"}}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Ensure the statement of changes in equity and capital disclosures are complete and accurate.\",\"ar\":\"Ensure the statement of changes in equity and capital disclosures are complete and accurate.\"}},{\"id\":\"sch_re\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Movement schedule: Retained earnings (LS-RE)\",\"ar\":\"جدول الحركة: Retained earnings (LS-RE)\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"sch_re\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Retained earnings movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"جدول حركة Retained earnings\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"component\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Component\",\"ar\":\"المكوّن\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"retained_earnings\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Retained earnings\",\"ar\":\"الأرباح المحتجزة\"}}]},{\"id\":\"opening\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Opening balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الافتتاحي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"additions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Profit for the year\",\"ar\":\"ربح السنة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"disposals\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Dividends\",\"ar\":\"توزيعات الأرباح\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"transfers\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Transfers to and from reserves\",\"ar\":\"التحويلات من الاحتياطيات وإليها\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"revaluation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Remeasurements recognised directly\",\"ar\":\"إعادة القياس المعترف بها مباشرة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"other\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Other movements\",\"ar\":\"حركات أخرى\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"closing\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Closing balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الختامي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true}]},{\"id\":\"sch_re_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-RE.difference\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_re_agrees\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Schedule agrees to the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-RE.agrees\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_re_opening_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the opening total and the prior period\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-RE.opening_difference\",\"readonly\":true}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Retained earnings reconciled from the opening to the closing balance, one component of the statement of changes in equity. Required by IAS 1.106. Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Retained earnings (LS-RE) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.\",\"ar\":\"يشترطه IAS 1.106. الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Retained earnings (LS-RE) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق.\"}}],\"signoff\":{\"prepare\":[\"partner\",\"manager\",\"senior\",\"staff\"],\"review\":[\"partner\",\"manager\"],\"approve\":[\"partner\"]},\"computation\":\"rollforward\",\"version\":2,\"ar_status\":\"draft_pending_review\"}"),
    ("F38-TAXES", "{\"id\":\"F38-TAXES\",\"number\":38,\"kind\":\"worksheet\",\"phase\":\"fieldwork\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Income and indirect taxes working paper\",\"ar\":\"ورقة عمل ضرائب الدخل والضرائب غير المباشرة\"},\"purpose\":{\"en\":\"Document every substantive procedure of the income and indirect taxes cycle: the work, the results, the evidence and the conclusion, against the balances the trial balance holds.\",\"ar\":\"توثيق كل إجراء أساسي في دورة ضرائب الدخل والضرائب غير المباشرة: العمل والنتائج والأدلة والاستنتاج، مقابل الأرصدة الواردة في ميزان المراجعة.\"},\"procedures\":[\"P-TAX-001\",\"P-TAX-002\",\"P-TAX-003\",\"P-TAX-004\",\"P-TAX-005\"],\"standards\":[\"ISA-330\",\"ISA-250\",\"ISA-501\",\"ISA-540\"],\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"engagement\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Engagement\",\"ar\":\"الارتباط\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"client\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Entity audited\",\"ar\":\"المنشأة محل المراجعة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.client\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_start\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period from\",\"ar\":\"الفترة من\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_start\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_end\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period to\",\"ar\":\"الفترة إلى\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_end\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"framework\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Financial reporting framework\",\"ar\":\"إطار التقرير المالي\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.framework\",\"readonly\":true}]},{\"id\":\"balances\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Balances, materiality and risks\",\"ar\":\"الأرصدة والأهمية النسبية والمخاطر\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"performance_materiality\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performance materiality\",\"ar\":\"مادية الأداء\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.performance\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"clearly_trivial\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Clearly trivial threshold\",\"ar\":\"حد المبالغ التافهة بشكل واضح\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.clearly_trivial\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_dta\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Deferred tax assets (LS-DTA)\",\"ar\":\"Deferred tax assets (LS-DTA)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-DTA\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_dta_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Deferred tax assets, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Deferred tax assets، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-DTA.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_taxa\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Current tax assets (LS-TAXA)\",\"ar\":\"Current tax assets (LS-TAXA)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-TAXA\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_taxa_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Current tax assets, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Current tax assets، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-TAXA.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_dtl\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Deferred tax liabilities (LS-DTL)\",\"ar\":\"Deferred tax liabilities (LS-DTL)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-DTL\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_dtl_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Deferred tax liabilities, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Deferred tax liabilities، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-DTL.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_taxl\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Current tax liabilities (LS-TAXL)\",\"ar\":\"Current tax liabilities (LS-TAXL)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-TAXL\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_taxl_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Current tax liabilities, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Current tax liabilities، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-TAXL.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_vat\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"VAT and other indirect taxes (LS-VAT)\",\"ar\":\"VAT and other indirect taxes (LS-VAT)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-VAT\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_vat_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"VAT and other indirect taxes, prior period\",\"ar\":\"VAT and other indirect taxes، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-VAT.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_taxexp\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Income tax expense (LS-TAXEXP)\",\"ar\":\"Income tax expense (LS-TAXEXP)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-TAXEXP\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_taxexp_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Income tax expense, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Income tax expense، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-TAXEXP.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"risks\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risks placed on this cycle by the risk register\",\"ar\":\"المخاطر الموضوعة على هذه الدورة في سجل المخاطر\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"form.F04-RISK-REGISTER.risks\",\"readonly\":true,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"level\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Level\",\"ar\":\"المستوى\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"assertions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Assertions affected\",\"ar\":\"الإقرارات المتأثرة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"inherent_risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Inherent risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر الملازم\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"significant\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Significant risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر مهم\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"control_risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Control risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر الرقابة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"response\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Planned response\",\"ar\":\"الاستجابة المخططة\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":false}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Balances are read from the latest accepted trial balance and frozen when the paper is prepared; a later import marks them as drifted.\",\"ar\":\"تُقرأ الأرصدة من أحدث ميزان مراجعة مقبول وتُثبت عند إعداد الورقة؛ ويؤدي استيراد لاحق إلى وسمها بأنها تغيرت.\"}},{\"id\":\"p_tax_001\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"P-TAX-001 Current income tax computation\",\"ar\":\"P-TAX-001 احتساب ضريبة الدخل الحالية\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"p_tax_001_work\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Work performed\",\"ar\":\"العمل المنفذ\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_tax_001_result\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Results and exceptions\",\"ar\":\"النتائج والاستثناءات\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_tax_001_samples\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-TAX-001\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_tax_001_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-TAX-001\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_tax_001_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable, reason stated\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق، مع بيان السبب\"}}]},{\"id\":\"p_tax_001_s1_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"ISA-250.14: Obtain sufficient appropriate evidence about compliance with those laws and regulations generally recognised to have a direct effect on material amounts and disclosures in the financial statements.\",\"ar\":\"ISA-250.14: Obtain sufficient appropriate evidence about compliance with those laws and regulations genera